Subject: [PATCH 1/3] =?UTF-8?q?=F0=9F=94=8A=20Myinstants=20auto=20sounds?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20+=20=F0=9F=8E=9B=EF=B8=8F=20deep=20Merge=20customization=20e?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ngine,=20CLI,=20batch,=20presets?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- mm911/sounds.py: Myinstants search (stdlib html/re + urllib), polite UA, timeout, retries,
  week-long search cache, download-once sound cache (%APPDATA%/MoneyMaker911/sounds, ~/.mm911/sounds
  or MM911_SOUND_CACHE), pitch analysis (spectral centroid + autocorrelation f0 via FFmpeg + numpy),
  auto plan mapping sounds to tiers low -> high (one sound pitched up, or several sorted by measured
  pitch then shifted), separate drop / final sounds, graceful fallback to the built-in pop
- audio.py: SoundBank (per-tier sounds, semitone overrides, pitch step/jitter, drop/final sounds and
  volumes) on top of the v0.4 decoder; decode() helper for analysis
- config: 86 new settings (physics, size curves, container colour/glow/custom polygon, spin wobble,
  solid / 3-stop angled gradient / image / looping video backgrounds, ball outline/shadow/glow, particle
  styles/colours, shake, combos, banners, slow-mo, near-miss, progress bar, counter, per-text styling,
  ending texts, until-finished, 15s preset); tiers stay the 3-15 "forms" setting; tier_radius = v0.3.1
  fit-to-container (auto_fit) + size_curve / custom sizes / ball_scale
- merge sim: video-time clock (SoundEvent.vt; audio stays in sync with speed AND slow motion), slow-mo
  final merge, cascade combos, tier banners, shake, near-miss tension, new shapes (triangle, pentagon,
  diamond, rounded, custom); extra effect randomness on its own RNG so existing seeds re-render the same
- render: all of the above drawn at any export resolution; video background via FFmpeg pipe;
  build_audio uses SoundBank + video time; auto sounds resolved before rendering
- CLI: --myinstants, --auto-sounds, --sound-strategy/--sound-count/--drop-keyword/--final-keyword,
  look flags (--forms --shape --gravity --bg-colors --particles --shake ...), --set KEY=VALUE,
  'sounds search|fetch|analyze|auto|cache'; batch --randomize knobs + --sound-keywords
- presets: neon_triangle_combo, space_planets_slowmo, custom_bowl_confetti, minimal_mono_15s
