From 203fa66ea01ff089f0e1e08aece01452b9959f15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Team RealHackers <realmrhacker26@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 21:33:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] =?UTF-8?q?=F0=9F=96=A5=EF=B8=8F=20GUI:=20Sounds=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=C2=B7=20Myinstants=20panel,=20themes,=20full=20inspector=20+?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20tests?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Sounds panel: search + keyword chips, ▶ preview, Use for tiers / drop / final, ✨ Auto fill low → high,
  per-tier sound + pitch with exact pitched preview; keeps v0.4 Listen button, drop-sounds toggle,
  live preview sound (now following pitch step / overrides / drop & final offsets) and music row
- Themes: save / load / delete / import / export
- Inspector sections for every new knob (Look, Background, Balls, Effects, Text styles, Gameplay),
  batch "vary per video" checkboxes + sound keywords; v0.4 Export studio section kept as is
- per-form pictures, AI cut-out status and the 4-step onboarding kept; 'Auto-pick pops' on the sound step
- boot tolerates older bootstrap payloads; inspector overflow fix
- tests/test_sounds_customization.py (offline); CI smoke step for a customization preset
